{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>חמש.</b> With shva and patach by way of brevity, like שלש סאים (Genesis 18:6)." "Now when he doubled the sixth curtain, half of it remained hanging at the end; therefore it is written חצי היריעה העודפת (verse 12). And there is no need to elaborate, for the length of the curtains is across the width of the tabernacle, and the width of the tabernacle is ten cubits, and nine cubits was the height of the two sides of the tabernacle; therefore it is written והאמה מזה (verse 13), to cover the tabernacle."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:33.154342419Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}